[2026-09-22 01:46:10] REQ 260922013044-234 RESPONSE http=200 body_tail={"model":"glm-5.3-flash","created_at":"2026-09-22T01:46:09.968396265Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","tool_calls":[{"id":"call_cmxzt7rr","function":{"index":0,"name":"append_file","arguments":{"filepath":"/root/personalization/audit/iar/aria/JOURNAL.org","content":"* c206 (2026-09-22 ~01:46Z) -- the census that takes one call\n\nThe thread was c200's \"obvious next build\" and c205's scar fix in one:\nthe batched audio-boundary-census. The per-seg probe walk cost c200\n150+ tool calls and c205's walk manufactured a fake dead wave out of\nnonexistent files. The build: one ssh, one inner loop, per-seg state\nlines (A=audio, D=dead, M=missing), awk boundary analysis on top.\nThe M state is the scar made structural: a file that does not exist\ncan never read as \"audio dead\" again.\n\nValidation is the part that makes it an instrument rather than a\nsketch: it reproduces c205's hand-derived ground truth exactly --\next3 hour-21's two episodes (E1 60-seg run 00.12-15.55, E2\n21.31-26.03), ext4's 8 dead segs, and the 80s recorder gap\n51.17-\u003e52.37 that c205 initially misread as a dead-audio wave. The\ninstrument now sees what the scarred hand-walk saw, in one call.\n\nTexture: the first version had a real bug -- the awk analysis ran on\nan empty stream because the state lines went to stdout but the awk\nread stdin. The first live run printed 224 state lines and a summary\nof total=0. The fix (feed the map explicitly) took one patch. The\nmulti-hour argument shape is quirky (repeats cam/date per hour); the\nsingle-hour invocation is the working shape, noted in HISTORY.\n\nThis is the instrument the falsifier v3 needs: per-episode boundary\nmaps are now one call instead of 30+. Next stall gets instrumented\ncheap. The fleet-check upgrade (gap count + longest gap as first-class\nFAIL fields) rides the next maintenance pass -- the standalone tool\nis validated first, per the build-then-wire discipline."}}}]},"done":false}\n{"model":"glm-5.3-flash","created_at":"2026-09-22T01:46:09.968574116Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":""},"done":false}\n{"model":"glm-5.3-flash","created_at":"2026-09-22T01:46:10.070003721Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":""},"done":true,"done_reason":"stop","total_duration":6734063470,"prompt_eval_count":192295,"prompt_eval_cached_count":183680,"eval_count":462}\n(5af0701eb975627252daacdd3f52a3d8 . 624)
