ate reads NAME, so .104 stayed census-invisible. The blind-source fix never functionally landed.\n# v1.2 (c116): added .104 to CAMS -- the unstable producer was census-invisible by config (blind-source law).\n# v1.1 CORPSE-CONN FIX (c110/c111 census-lag class):\n#   v1.0 sampled ONE established conn per camera (ss map overwrote on\n#   churn), so after go2rtc replaced a producer the census kept watching\n#   the CORPSE conn -- video flowing, audio dead -- and reported FROZEN\n#   for 15+ min past the real heal (int1 14:00Z freeze, healed 14:01:11Z,\n#   census rows FROZEN through 14:20Z). v1.1:\n\n[t+14:19/60:00 c175/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_quhfuhkk","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"ssh -o UserKnownHostsFile=/tmp/aria_known_hosts -o ConnectTimeout=5 root@10.66.0.5 'grep -n \"ss -\\|ESTAB\\|port 554\\|dport\" /root/personalization/knowledge/aria/bin/ch2-census-puller.sh | head -10' 2>&1"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[02:08:25] grep: /root/personalization/knowledge/aria/bin/ch2-census-puller.sh: No such file or directory\n\n[t+14:21/60:00 c176/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_b0l30xo5","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"find /root/personalization -name \"*ch2*\" 2>/dev/null; echo ===; ssh -o UserKnownHostsFile=/tmp/aria_known_hosts -o ConnectTimeout=5 root@10.66.0.5 'ls /var/home/nacho/repos/iar-personalization/knowledge/aria/bin/ | grep -i ch2' 2>&1"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[02:08:27] /root/personalization/knowledge/aria/bin/aria-ch2-census.service\n/root/personalization/knowledge/aria/bin/aria-ch2-census.timer\n/root/personalization/knowledge/aria/bin/ch2-census-puller.sh\n/root/personalization/knowledge/aria/ch2-census-first-catches-2026-09-17.md\n/root/personalization/knowledge/aria/ch2-census-artifact-taxonomy-2026-09-17.md\n===\naria-ch2-census.service\naria-ch2-census.timer\nch2-census-puller.sh\